# COBOL ACH Batch Validator Strategy Example
# Shifting processing queue thresholds for dynamic wire transit batches.

SET depth 8;
SET abductive 20;

# Prioritize specific validator keycodes (e.g. 70 representing ACH total checksum calculations)
WEIGHT 70 5;
WEIGHT 71 2;

# Prune processing priorities below limits
PRUNE 10;
EVAL;
